  "body": "> Verify that a suitable X-Frame-Options or Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors header is in use for sites where content should not be embedded in a third-party site.\r\n\r\nThis is only for Level 2+, but I don't see any reason why this shouldn't apply for Level 1 as well. It's a protection we expect and that most people would test for anyway. ",
